Behavioral Inhibitors"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Behavioral_Inhibitors"}," for a number of rounds equal to your ",{"tag":"a","children":["Intelligence"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Intelligence"}," bonus.\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"h3","children":["Heuristic Mastery"]},"\n",{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"i","children":["Prerequisite:"]}," ",{"tag":"a","children":["Wisdom"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Wisdom"}," 15\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":["You understand the subtleties and limitations of your ",{"tag":"a","children":["Heuristic Processor"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Heuristic_Processor","referenceId":"reference:0c5e1a481742e09b"},". You can reroll any ",{"tag":"a","children":["Untrained"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Untrained"}," skill check (except ",{"tag":"a","children":["Use the Force"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Use_the_Force","referenceId":"reference:74883d1dd46b87fe"},"), but the result of the reroll must be accepted, even if it is worse. Once per encounter, you can spend a ",{"tag":"a","children":["Force Point"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Force_Point"}," to reroll any ",{"tag":"a","children":["Skill Check"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Skill_Check"}," (",{"tag":"a","children":["Trained"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Trained"}," or ",{"tag":"a","children":["Untrained"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Untrained"},"), keeping the better of the two results.\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"h3","children":["Scripted Routines"]},"\n",{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"i","children":["Prerequisite:"]}," ",{"tag":"a","children":["Base Attack Bonus"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Base_Attack_Bonus"}," +5\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":["Your extensive experience allows you to preset specific routines that give you an advantage in some situations. Once per encounter you can use each of the following actions:\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"ul","children":[{"tag":"li","children":[{"tag":"i","children":["Attack Script:"]}," You can use a ",{"tag":"a","children":["Feat"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Feat"}," or a ",{"tag":"a","children":["Talent"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Talent"}," that modifies your attack roll as one Action less (for example, a ",{"tag":"a","children":["Full-Round Action"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Full-Round_Action"}," becomes a ",{"tag":"a","children":["Standard Action"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Standard_Action"},", a ",{"tag":"a","children":["Standard Action"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Standard_Action"}," becomes a ",{"tag":"a","children":["Move Action"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Move_Action"},", a ",{"tag":"a","children":["Move Action"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Move_Action"}," becomes a ",{"tag":"a","children":["Swift Action"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Swift_Action"},", a ",{"tag":"a","children":["Swift Action"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Swift_Action"}," becomes a ",{"tag":"a","children":["Free Action"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Free_Action"},")."]},"\n",{"tag":"li","children":[{"tag":"i","children":["Defense Script:"]}," You can apply your ",{"tag":"a","children":["Independent Spirit"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Independent_Spirit"}," bonus a second time during a single encounter."]},"\n",{"tag":"li","children":[{"tag":"i","children":["Skill Script:"]}," While in combat, you can apply a bonus equal to one-half of your Class Level to any single ",{"tag":"a","children":["Skill"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Skill"}," that requires a ",{"tag":"a","children":["Standard Action"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Standard_Action"}," or less to use. You must be ",{"tag":"a","children":["Trained"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Trained"}," in the chosen ",{"tag":"a","children":["Skill"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Skill"}," to activate this ability."]}]},"\n",{"tag":"h3","children":["Ultra Resilient"]},"\n",{"tag":"p","children":["You have advanced subroutines that make you more resistant to the effect of damage. Once per encounter, as a ",{"tag":"a","children":["Reaction"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Reaction"},", you can increase your ",{"tag":"a","children":["Damage Threshold"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Damage_Threshold"}," with a bonus equal to your ",{"tag":"a","children":["Independent Droid"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Independent_Droid","referenceId":"reference:6970f6ef6b1a6030"}," level.\n"]},"\n","\n","\n","\n\n","\n\n","\n"]}}
